          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will a magnetic car mount hold my phone properly?",
            "content": "<p>Magnetic mounts need either a MagSafe-compatible case or a metal ring fitted between your phone and its case. Thick rugged cases weaken the hold, so a clip-on or gooseneck mount is safer for those. Each product page lists the mounting type, whether it is vent, dashboard or windscreen.</p>"
          }
